  "limits": [
    "No public main-playable fighter DOMDocument/FLA/ZIP at this pinned submodule tree.",
    "ninja1 has a real three-hit chain; no active SJ/WJ/I/SI/WI/air skill labels. Its 招1_UN_USE is explicitly unused.",
    "The broad label duration is not startup+active+recovery: scripts such as idle jump away before the next label.",
    "setAttack opens an input permission slot; endAct clears action permissions and sets FREEZE. Neither event is the same as a hitbox lifetime.",
    "isWeak is preserved as raw authored data but is not a declared HitVO field in pinned runtime; actual weak-hit evaluation is isWeakHit().",
    "No ActionScript executed, and no art/bitmap/DAT/FLA/SWF downloaded.",
    "This NPC chain is a sequence of input-permission windows, not a guaranteed playable-character true combo. Its authored hurtTime0 and later setAttack windows can leave a recovery gap; do not invent stun to hide it."
  ]
